It reads the public data of the Space Weather Prediction Center (SWPC) of the
U.S. National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration (NOAA), at
https://services.swpc.noaa.gov/. Those data are in the public domain; the
SWPC asks to be credited as "NOAA Space Weather Prediction Center". This
integration is not affiliated with nor endorsed by the NOAA or the SWPC, and
uses neither their name as a brand nor their logo.

The sun elevation follows the published equations of the NOAA solar
calculator (https://gml.noaa.gov/grad/solcalc/calcdetails.html). The test
fixtures under test/fixtures/swpc/ are files of the SWPC downloaded on
2026-10-23 (public domain).
